{
 "id": "opm-cba",
 "title": "OPM union contracts",
 "blurb": "Every federal collective bargaining agreement in OPM's public database, with a first-pass flag for which were terminated.",
 "hfDataset": "abigailhaddad/opm-cba-agreements",
 "source": {
  "format": "csv",
  "urls": [
   "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/opm-cba-agreements/resolve/main/agreements.csv"
  ]
 },
 "key": "id",
 "asOf": {
  "sql": "SELECT CAST(count(*) AS VARCHAR) || ' agreements, ' || CAST(sum(CASE WHEN download_status = 'ok' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS VARCHAR) || ' with a downloaded file' FROM t",
  "label": "In this table: {value}."
 },
 "covers": "One row per record in OPM's collective bargaining agreement database, with OPM's own fields, the downloaded PDF and its extracted text (stored on Hugging Face), and a termination flag from the executive orders that removed agencies from collective bargaining. This is an unofficial copy.",
 "caveats": [
  "The termination flags are leads to check, not findings. \"inferred\" means the agency ended all its agreements in some category and this one falls in it (mostly Defense); the order itself could not be downloaded.",
  "Court and injunction status goes stale quickly. Check any single flag before relying on it.",
  "OPM requires covered agencies to report each agreement's status monthly. That spreadsheet would be the real list, and it is not public.",
  "Some records share one file, and a few listed files could not be downloaded (see Download status). Scanned agreements have little or no text; no OCR was run.",
  "The table is a snapshot. The listing check runs weekly, but the file downloads, text and flags are rebuilt by hand."
 ],
 "links": [
  {
   "label": "Dataset card",
   "href": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/opm-cba-agreements"
  },
  {
   "label": "Code and methods",
   "href": "https://github.com/abigailhaddad/opm-cba-archive"
  },
  {
   "label": "OPM's database",
   "href": "https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-oversight/labor-management-relations/collective-bargaining-agreements/"
  }
 ],
 "searchColumns": [
  "agencyName",
  "subAgencyOrComponent",
  "laborUnionName",
  "fileName",
  "activityOfficeRegion"
 ],
 "defaultSort": {
  "col": "agencyName",
  "dir": "asc"
 },
 "pageSize": 50,
 "detail": {
  "title": "{agencyName}: {laborUnionName}",
  "links": [
   {
    "label": "PDF on Hugging Face",
    "href": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/opm-cba-agreements/resolve/main/pdfs/{id:enc}.pdf",
    "showIf": {
     "col": "download_status",
     "equals": "ok"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "Extracted text",
    "href": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/abigailhaddad/opm-cba-agreements/resolve/main/text/{id:enc}.txt",
    "showIf": {
     "col": "download_status",
     "equals": "ok"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "File on OPM's site",
    "href": "{fileUrl}"
   }
  ]
 },
